  "purpose": "Continue the mature Jev-directed musical-relational investigation and test its hypotheses across source-native system hierarchies in SUNNY's intended common geometric structure. Preserve continuity and progressively derived comparison/type capabilities while pursuing the explicit calendar and symbol/sound outcomes. Parallel historical forensics repairs omitted, misinterpreted or incorrectly carried relationships; it is not the whole assignment.",
  "original_two_purposes": [
    "Solve contextual continuity failures, including forgotten discoveries, decisions, questions and their dependencies.",
    "Equip the investigation with a progressively derived typed system for recognizing musical-geometric patterns, operators and dynamics in other systems, equations, traditions and mathematical bodies."
  ],
  "working_premises": {
    "musical_reference": "Complete native mathematical, structural, operational, harmonic, temporal, compositional and orchestral relations of music are SUNNY's deterministic reference, not only a scalar equation or finite carrier.",
    "intended_geometry": "The complete intended geometry, systemic/generational wheels, two rotations per class before lift and Sierpinski-tetrahedral Monad at infinitum remain the adopted working premise. Exact realizations, mappings and consequences must be recovered and tested within that premise.",
    "host_boundary": "The host must not replace these premises with its preferred research mission. Jev-directed investigation and faithful source/derivation accounting remain required; a Jev preference is not a mathematical proof."
  },
  "investigation_tracks": [
    {
      "id": "calendar_counterfactuals",
      "role": "explicit_overarching_outcome",
      "question": "Rectify date/time from the relevant historical perspectives by comparing uninterrupted institutional use with scenarios affected by specified calendar-system changes.",
